  "description": "**** Email enquiries only for this property together with a reference from a current/previous landlord ****\n\nThis traditional, character-filled cottage is ready to move into - it is fully furnished and available from 1st October. \n\nThe property is ideally positioned in a picturesque rural setting, yet close to Macroom, Coachford, Ballincollig, and Blarney. Own transport is required.\n\nAccommodation comprises a front porch, a welcoming living/dining room with a beautiful Stanley stove, a cosy sitting room, a bright and modern kitchen, a bathroom, and two bedrooms (adjoined) upstairs. \n\nThe property is positioned adjacent to a family residence but benefits from its own front door, parking area, and outdoor garden space. \n\nThe property is being offered on a minimum 1 year lease agreement only. \n\n- Central heating throughout (oil)\n- Solid fuel Stanley stove\n- 1x double bedroom plus 1x twin bedroom (adjoined)\n- WIFI \n- Parking for 2x cars\n- Small front garden\n- Gas oven/hob/grill\n- Washing machine, dishwasher, microwave, electric shower, Saorview\n\n**STRICTLY NO PETS ALLOWED**\n**NON SMOKERS ONLY**\n\nPlease email your enquiry AND reference from a current or previous landlord -  we will endeavour to respond to as many applicants as possible.",
